  `map_zero` on `phi0` are replaced by `phi0_add` (`LatticeQuadratic.lean`) and the new helpers
  `phi0_zero'`, `phi0_neg'` (through `phi0Lin`).
* **Re-proved steps (same statements):** `phi0_coordOf_inv` — the source rewrites with
